@reactions event.crossingLine.warning
// EW1 (events writer), Crossing the Line: from Saturday 18:00 (Vance's Mail) to Sunday 14:30, crew talk about "the
// Line"; some ask "first crossing?".
? cue:event.crossingLine.warning
- We cross the Line tomorrow. First time? You'll love it. Mostly.   #funny
- First crossing? Lucky you. Don't drink the punch. You'll drink the punch.   #funny
- The Line's tomorrow. The horn goes on every deck. Don't jump.
- Tomorrow we cross into the Veyli reach. New stars out of the windows.
? cue:event.crossingLine.warning tier>=acquaintance
- First crossing, {nick}? Stand at the front tomorrow. That's the rule.
? cue:event.crossingLine.warning dept:galley
- Line punch tomorrow. Brennan's recipe. We don't ask what's in it.   #funny
? cue:event.crossingLine.warning dept:helm
- Tomorrow at half two we cross the Line. Helm's flying it. Gently.
? cue:event.crossingLine.warning dept:survey
- New reach, new charts. Survey's been waiting months for this.
? cue:event.crossingLine.warning tier>=friend
- I'll stand with you tomorrow. Everyone needs someone at their first Line.   #warm
? cue:event.crossingLine.warning who:pell
- My first Line was two years ago. I still dream about that punch.   #funny
// Holt's one line: the here and now only (his arc: nothing of borders, past crossings or the Veyli)
? cue:event.crossingLine.warning who:holt
- Crossing or no crossing, the plaza stays tidy. No punch on my deck.
